                <pb facs="0334" n="246" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg246"/>

                <head>Supplementary convention between the United States and Cuba extending the
                    period within which may be exchanged the ratifications of the treaty of May 22,
                    1903, between the United States and Cuba, embodying the provisions defining
                    their future relations</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Washington, January 20, 1904.<lb/>Ratification
                        advised by the Senate, January 27, 1904.<lb/>Ratified by the President, June
                        25, 1904.<lb/>Ratified by Cuba, June 20, 1904.<lb/>Ratifications exchanged
                        at Washington, July 1, 1904.<lb/>Proclaimed, July 2, 1904.</hi></p>

                <xi:include href="ch51/d208.xml" xpointer="d208"/>
